domain AgencyV3Verification:
  description "Record local verification and reviewed causal propagation without claiming model quality."
problem P1:
  |
    V3 implementation changes shared legacy files and current plan state.
    Acceptance and new implementation must remain distinguishable from historical
    requirement snapshots and CA00 baseline observations.
evidence E_LOCAL:
  |
    Local full suite passed 708 tests before adding one real V3 creation test.
    The added SQLite V3 creation/advance test and two persistence tests pass.
    Typecheck and build passed. Lizard1.23.0 passed unchanged thresholds after
    brace-bodied callbacks avoided its cross-function parser mismeasurement.
    An internal redaction regression was caused by a global facts-key match;
    it was removed and the immutable asset integration test passed again.
evidence E_GATES:
  |
    npm run adr:check is absent in this worktree. Direct CLI ADR audit succeeded
    with zero fatal/error/warning, but does not establish that npm gate ran.
    Exact owner approval exists; a second independent review is unperformed.
evidence E_IMPACT:
  |
    Impact was read against the existing sealed heads of ten changed references.
    Runtime edits had already begun before this turn's impact capture; do not
    call that capture pre-edit. No heads had been resealed at capture time.
    Reachable documents include historical v1 requirement/review/acceptance and
    CA00 tests, current v2 requirements/ADR, plans, index and old impact report.
premise BOUNDARY:
  |
    A seal is causal traceability, not owner approval, fresh execution or proof
    of semantic quality. Preserve exact accepted requirement bytes and old run
    counts. Current legacy regression can support continued applicability of
    the old baseline contract without saying the old run executed V3.
decision D1 based_on P1, E_LOCAL, E_GATES, E_IMPACT, BOUNDARY:
  |
    Update current plans with direct approval, local implementation and remaining
    formal-check/review limitations. Keep t029 active while its required checks
    are incomplete. Record current verification separately from historical runs.
    Recheck changed code and each impacted document before individual reseal;
    preserve historical requirement/review bytes and annotate the continued
    legacy-only applicability at reviewed cause links. Register new V3 artifacts.
    Do not activate settings, call a paid provider, deploy, commit or push.
